# Path-based 301 redirects from the old WordPress site.
# Query-string redirects (?p=N, ?page_id=N, ?post_type=...) are handled
# by functions/_middleware.ts because CF Pages `_redirects` does not match
# against the query string.
#
# IMPORTANT: static rules must come BEFORE splat (*) rules, or wrangler
# warns about reduced performance.

# Internal slug rename (May 2026): split PID/intertravamentos/sequenciamento
/tecnologias/pid-intertravamentos-sequenciamento  /tecnologias/intertravamentos-sequencias  301
/tecnologias/pid-intertravamentos-sequenciamento/ /tecnologias/intertravamentos-sequencias  301

# Integra Ação umbrella brand: /integra-acao/eventos is an alias for /eventos
